# Voice Therapy Pipeline

## Architecture

Little Nate Voice Therapy runs on phone number **656-231-8192** via a Twilio Media Stream → Grok Realtime API → TTS pipeline.

| Component | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Pipeline | `twilio_grok_xtts_pipeline.py` | Media stream handler, Grok session, TTS, memory, billing |
| Billing | `voice_billing.py` | Prepaid minute-block purchase, deduction, extension |
| Metering | `voice_metering.py` | Bridge between prepaid billing and legacy tier system |
| Notifications | `voice_notifications.py` | SMS alerts (welcome, low balance, session summary, recovery) |
| Phone Utils | `voice_phone.py` | Phone normalization, carrier lookup |
| Webhook | `voice_webhook_handler.py` | Stripe webhook for voice block purchases |
| Migration | `migrations/voice_billing_migration.sql` | `voice_accounts`, `voice_sessions`, `voice_transactions`, `voice_crystals`, `voice_leads` |

